R5. No two records agree in both `module` and `student`; agreeing in just one of the two is fine.
R6. `lab_slot` may be empty only if `needs_lab` is not "yes".
R7. Within the batch, all values of `enrol_id` differ from one another.
R8. Exactly one of `invoice_ref` and `grant_id` must be filled in: never both, never neither.

