R5. Each `branch` has to appear in the reference list `branches` with the status "current"; an entry with any other status does not count.
R6. In every record, `days_late` times `daily_fee` gives exactly `fine`.
R7. No value of `condition_out` other than "damaged", "good", "new", "marked" is accepted.

