Record fields: reading_id (text), temp_c (whole number), operator (text), cycle (text), frame_no (whole number), alarm_code (text), void_samples (whole number), mode (text), probe (text), all_samples (whole number), sensor (text), script_id (text), alarm (text), gateway (text), zone (text), valid_samples (whole number), recheck_of (text).

Rules:
R1. Exactly one of `script_id` and `operator` must be filled in: never both, never neither.
R2. `all_samples` must equal `valid_samples` plus `void_samples`.
R3. `alarm_code` may be empty only if `alarm` is not "yes".
R4. A combination of `probe` and `cycle` that turns up in two records is not allowed, although each of the two fields may repeat by itself.
