R5. `taken_on` is never after `uploaded_on`; both on the same day is acceptable.
R6. `script_id` and `operator` exclude each other, and one of them is always filled in.
R7. Each `gateway` has to appear in the reference list `gateways` with the status "active"; an entry with any other status does not count.

Reference list `gateways` with 9 entries, one per line (key: status):
GW-13: suspended
GW-20: suspended
GW-24: active
GW-44: active
GW-51: active
GW-68: suspended
GW-73: active
GW-81: inactive
GW-85: active

The status written beside a key counts only for a rule that names a status. Every other rule that refers to the list accepts all of its keys, whatever their status.

