R6. `packaging` is restricted to this list: "pallet", "sack", "crate".
R7. If `signature` equals "yes", an empty `receiver` is not allowed.
R8. If `service` is "freight", `length_cm` is at least 30 and at most 200; if `service` is "letter", at least 12 and at most 40.

