R5. `starts_on` precedes `ends_on`, and the two never coincide.
R6. Each record fills in either `grant_id` or `invoice_ref`, but not both and not neither.
R7. `amount_due` is the sum of `tuition` and `materials`; any other stored value breaks the rule.
