A loader validates shift entry records batch by batch; the rules it applies and the next batch (24 records) are shown below. Either every rule holds or exactly one is broken, at one spot. Nothing is a violation unless a listed rule, taken literally, forbids it.

Record fields: entry_id (text), overnight (text), role (text), worked_on (date, YYYY-MM-DD), project_code (text), roster (text), approved_on (date, YYYY-MM-DD), corrects (text), cover_role (text), slot (text), site (text), hourly_rate (whole number), break_min (whole number), grade (text), row_no (whole number), allowance_code (text), cost_centre (text).

